Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "A demon and its pet... Oh, how I'd love to tame them.
But I worry that they're too much to handle, even for me.",
  "1.0.1.0" => "In that case...why not exploit the strength of the local humans?",
  "1.0.2.0" => "I've come to...ugh...aid your cause. Together we will make
short work of these creatures.",
  "1.0.4.0" => "I must recommend you prioritize the defeat of the demon
and The Imprisoned above all other tasks.",
  "1.0.5.0" => "Who dares interfere in the works of Lord Ghirahim?!
I must punish you most...deliciously.",
  "1.0.6.0" => "The small one is controlling the big one! If he takes our base,
we lose, so put your backs into it!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "Ohhh, do you worms call this hole in the earth your base? I will
destroy this eyesore and dance magnificently on its remains!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "Guard our base! If anything happens to it, I will make sure the
same thing happens to you ten times over!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "There's a presence inside the sorceress... Could it be...?
No, impossible.",
  "1.0.11.0" => "I am incapable of continuing to fight... Likelihood of victory is
now 1.3%...",
  "1.0.12.0" => "That went rather well! Next, let's recruit our eccentric friend.",
  "1.0.13.0" => "The Imprisoned has fallen...? How? Well, I can still turn this
around if I can take their base.",
  "1.0.14.0" => "There. I cleaned up your mess.",
  "1.0.16.0" => "I underestimated you and the depths to which you would sink to
win. Obviously I could learn from you...if you'll let me join up.",
  "1.0.17.0" => "That's it? Your obedience is bought so cheaply?",
  "1.0.18.0" => "I'm not complaining. And now that we've tamed the demon tribe,
we have no further use for the humans of this land.",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Thank you! We'll take all the help we can get!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "That sword spirit is the only thing keeping the human army
together. If we defeat her, their ranks will crumble.",
  "1.0.23.0" => "A source of great evil has been identified within the enemy
sorceress. Recommend directing maximum force against her.",
  "1.0.24.0" => "The newcomers have betrayed us! All troops, we must protect
Skyloft! Attack!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "The newcomers have betrayed us! All troops, we must protect
Skyloft! Attack!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "Even these rodents can be trouble if they gain
momentum. Take their keeps and crush their spirit!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "They're going for our keeps! That means their base
is unguarded! We can use this!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "We're getting pushed back...",
  "1.0.30.0" => "Skyloft's defensive forces are rapidly losing combat
effectiveness...",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Our base is overrun. We've lost.",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Hgh... Shouldn't have held back... My fight is over...",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Coward! Stop sneaking around and face me!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "A lizard in human's clothing could never comprehend
the subtle genius of my work.",
  "1.0.35.0" => "They're putting up a decent fight. We should take
over some of their keeps and get the advantage back.",
  "1.0.36.0" => "And, with that, the land in the sky is mine.",
  "1.0.37.0" => "I bow to your strength. Please, allow me to conquer
the rest of this world for you. You deserve it, Mistress.",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Probability of the Hero eventually appearing is 100%.
I will stand by until then.",
  "1.0.41.0" => "Coward! Stop sneaking around and face me!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "A lizard in human's clothing could never comprehend
the subtle genius of my work.",
  "1.0.43.0" => "The demon is nothing special, but this giant beast
may prove too great a challenge, even for us.",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Well, we're not going to fight it head-on, lizard brain!
We'll soften it up with some locals first.",
  "1.0.45.0" => "The demon is nothing special, but this giant beast
may prove too great a challenge, even for us.",
  "1.0.46.0" => "I know, dear--that's why we're not going to fight it
head-on. We'll convince the humans to help.",
  "1.0.47.0" => "First we need to win the trust of these people...
Go take back one of their keeps as a start.",
  "1.0.48.0" => "What? There's fighting going on
in the north as well?",
  "1.0.49.0" => "It is recommended that you defeat the
Giant Boss as quickly as possible.",
  "1.0.50.0" => "Well done, my sorceress queen!
A marvelous display of skill!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "His compliment rings hollow.
We'd be wise not to trust him.",
  "1.0.52.0" => "Come on! We need to take back this territory!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "More unsightly enemy troops. Ho hum.
Hurry and take their keeps.",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Is that all you can muster? Your weakness
far outweighs your power.",
  "1.0.55.0" => "You there! Deliver the goods to the front
lines and rescue our sorceress queen!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "Those monsters look like they're up to
something... Everyone, go and beat them!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Delightful! Everything went perfectly!
I hope our mistress is pleased.",
  "1.0.58.0" => "They've already been defeated?
How utterly useless...",
  "1.0.59.0" => "That sword spirit is quite a nuisance...
We need to capture its keep to weaken it!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "I will now move to intercept the
Giant Boss.",
  "1.0.61.0" => "Everyone, I command you to gather
around the Giant Boss at once!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "I've been defeated...
How humiliating!",
  "13.0.1.0" => "Enemies keep c-c-coming?
Take the keep!",
  "13.0.2.0" => "Let's earn the locals' trust and get some of their keeps back
for them, eh?",
  "13.0.3.0" => "Our base is without protection! Someone, help me defend it!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "That went well. Now we just have to recruit the monster boss--
gwee hee hee!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "Glad that's taken care of--let's get back to the task at hand.",
  "13.0.6.0" => "Since you asked so nicely, you may join me.",
  "13.0.7.0" => "Humans are a cancerous blight on these fair lands.
Let's excise it, hmmm?",
  "13.0.8.0" => "That spirit is the only thing on their side that even matters.
Kill her and the rest will be easy.",
  "13.0.9.0" => "Surprisingly durable. Perhaps we should concentrate on their
keeps and hurt their morale...",
  "13.0.10.0" => "We've lost our base? Someone's going to suffer very badly
for this...",
  "13.0.11.0" => "I lost? That's so...humiliating.",
  "13.0.12.0" => "This opponent is too strong for me. Can we attack their keeps
first?",
  "13.0.13.0" => "Let's earn the locals' trust and get some of their keeps back
for them, eh?",
}